      "wiki": {
        "extract": "S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 is the capital and largest city of the Central African island country of S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 and Pr\u00edncipe. Its name is Portuguese for \"Saint Thomas\". Founded in the 15th century, it is one of Africa's oldest colonial cities.",
