      "wiki": {
        "extract": "Portuguese S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 and Pr\u00edncipe was a colony of the Portuguese Empire from the discovery of the S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 and Pr\u00edncipe islands in 1470 until 1975, when independence was granted by Portugal.",
